[{"title":"秋暮杨体之明府过麦浪舫雨中盘桓三日","author":"朱福田","text":"清白子孙强项令，罢官来叩野人居。\n闭门三日潇潇雨，黄叶林中读道书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28945,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠圣因上人","author":"周曙","text":"即此隔人世，何须更买山。\n犹嫌云水竞，独自闭寒关。\n钟响空明外，莺啼杳霭间。\n毒龙思听法，隐约出溪湾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28946,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"月夜弹琴忆汪一江","author":"吴浩","text":"有怀不可见，秋阴生茅茨。\n坐久见明月，如与幽人期。\n写我琴中意，诉彼明月知。\n夜半松泉落，泠然天风吹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28947,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"红梅","author":"俞体莹","text":"不羡隋宫剪彩枝，丹砂变尽雪霜姿。\n罗浮仿佛桃源境，驴背诗人知未知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28948,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎丘怀古","author":"俞体莹","text":"花宫幽处阖闾坟，过客登临日半曛。\n宝气久消金虎穴，雄图空练水犀军。\n苔寒古甃深千尺，春老青山又十分。\n惟有高情王短薄，荒祠岑寂倚閒云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28949,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿栖霞岭金鼓洞赠蔡尊师","author":"俞体莹","text":"石洞最幽寂，从师养静根。\n清閒十二月，《道德》五千言。\n云懒长依岫，泉流自到门。\n山房客信宿，玄理共探论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28950,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山观即事","author":"俞体莹","text":"落日空林散紫烟，满阶瑶草碧芊芊。\n梦回虚阁云侵榻，诗和高僧鹤寄笺。\n列岫当窗开画嶂，双流合涧奏冰弦。\n凭栏极目层峦外，采药馀风未渺然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28951,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送陈静岩师入都","author":"俞体莹","text":"空山无计挽君留，高挂云帆蓟北游。\n明日春寒江上路，满天风雨一扁舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28952,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"豫让","author":"俞体莹","text":"知遇恩深一死轻，击衣溅血足心惊。\n龙门取合荆轲传，孤负千秋义士名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28953,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"乙丑十月望前一日同人小集赋诗","author":"张复纯","text":"古洞何年凿，吾家几叶传。\n招来云外侣，都是酒中仙。\n清兴殊无敌，清诗会有缘。\n迟迟下山去，谷鸟破轻烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28954,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"思天台歌","author":"仰蘅","text":"思天台，巍巍高矗四万八千丈，直接青天何高哉！\n气象磅礴倾五岳，烟云缥缈连蓬莱。\n岩坳涧曲著我一茅舍，吾将绝俗长往啸咏而徘徊。\n跨石梁之夭矫，睨瀑布之喧豗。\n但见叠翠层青，远近相拱揖。\n奔虹走雪，高下争流急。\n琼台斜通双阙道，瑶峰远映赤城色。\n夜半天鸡鸣，沧溟日欲出。\n光芒万缕朝曦升，颓然一醉扶桑霱。\n山中胜状难穷搜，仙之居兮神之游。\n司马一去已千载，瞻白云兮心悠悠。\n人间不觉羲娥迅，灵境千年才一瞬。\n君看刘、阮出桃源，世运几番更正闰。\n玉京有洞迷荒榛，中藏日月秋复春。\n石扉訇以乍启，仙都迥以无垠。\n紫鸾吹笙玄鹤舞，银堂瑶室多宫府。\n神苗异药葱茜连陇畦，人家花竹相望成村坞。\n愿向真官乞取閒，田圃灌木耘芝终此土。\n遐游物表以忘情，出入有无一今古。\n我思天台心魂劳，往往飞梦凌霞档。\n何当践莓苔援萝葛，一瓢一杖手自操，探幽访邃穷嶕峣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28955,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日偕王凤鹤登凤凰山访胜果寺展眺山顶探岭峪诸胜而归分韵得栖字","author":"仰蘅","text":"世网苦自缚，胜事恒多睽。\n幸兹及冬暖，欣与朋俦捣。\n汗漫何所之，言指城南溪。\n寒晖照霜岫，晓风犹含凄。\n兴来讵怯远，纵步凌丹梯。\n径盘木末出，下临飞鸟低。\n回环众峰合，中隐一招提。\n倚岩结危构，峍屼干云霓。\n寿藤走长蛇，怪石蹲勇猊。\n古刻蚀苔藓，欲读奚由稽。\n绝顶得快意，刮自开金鎞。\n江流浩东注，湖水横其西。\n远舟竞荡漾，泛泛如凫鹥。\n俯仰尽八极，顾我真醯鸡。\n岭云转深奥，树萟杂町畦。\n樵唱互响答，花木多幽蹊。\n行行遍搜探，得得杖一藜。\n但嫌腰脚弱，胜处莫穷跻。\n怅焉觅归路，回首苍烟迷。\n终应结茅宇，深托岩峦栖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28956,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日返语溪舟中即景 其一","author":"仰蘅","text":"水落清溪一棹过，西风杨柳尽婆娑。\n野禽飞去斜阳外，惟有寒烟衰草多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28957,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日返语溪舟中即景 其二","author":"仰蘅","text":"几点栖鸦缀老桑，数丛枯苇映寒塘。\n一年又是冬将尽，风送孤帆到女阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28958,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"首夏诸客见过山房次项丈秋子韵","author":"仰蘅","text":"从教庭草翠如葱，闭户惟依一亩宫。\n池水乍添鱼意乐，林深未密鸟声通。\n茶烟著竹成轻霭，琴响和云入远空。\n喜得联翩词客至，好追莲社结山中。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28959,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由都江堰至上元宫","author":"徐本衷","text":"一径穿云去，松间鹤自翔。\n小桥支古木，敝屋隐崇冈。\n樵斧丁丁凿，山花细细香。\n仙都看不远，晴翠染衣裳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28960,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由石碑铺至常道观","author":"徐本衷","text":"十里入云峰，步步超尘表。\n松桂似幽人，空谷环相绕。\n略彴驾危岩，小憩入遐想。\n不闻人语声，万壑松涛响。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28961,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初夏过友人新居","author":"徐本衷","text":"爱閒此物最怡情，竹屋绳床午睡清。\n除却酒瓢无长物，满帘新绿雨初晴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28962,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将抵灌口场口占","author":"徐本衷","text":"沼溪幽径曲，雨止讶新晴。\n石峭云犹住，峰回路忽平。\n牧童驱犊饮，老树集鸦鸣。\n遥望人烟集，逢场酒已倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28963,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其一","author":"陈敬","text":"大地风霜催岁暮，碧天星斗淡凉宵。\n千家砧杵声哀怨，一室篝镫影寂寥。\n壁下吟虫何唧唧，枥中鸣马更萧萧。\n遥知长胜幽燕将，偃月榆林正射雕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28964,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其二","author":"陈敬","text":"海国孤城夕照残，独依牛斗望长安。\n乱山落木秋声静，细雨疏镫客梦寒。\n天地苍茫离思迫，关河辽阔寄书难。\n请看梧竹栖鸾日，高举凌云振羽翰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28965,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其三","author":"陈敬","text":"万家水阔送朝凉，竟日城楼望大荒。\n烟外月生全海白，沙场日落半天黄。\n陆机早岁能工赋，阮籍穷途更放生。\n惟逐少陵徒结纳，掩关谁肯聚萤囊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28966,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其四","author":"陈敬","text":"枉说鱼盐富东海，频年水旱少丰登。\n民劳土瘠艰禾稼，野廓城荒蔓葛藤。\n磷火几家山鬼语，飓风永夜海蛟腾。\n江亭萧瑟闻哀雁，昂首高吟曲槛凭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28967,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋感 其五","author":"陈敬","text":"浪迹乾坤一马鞭，丈夫意气畏人怜。\n猿声朗啸千山月，鸿影孤飞万里天。\n陈箧苏秦方发愤，题桥司马未升仙。\n振衣直上高丘望，吴越川原起暮烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28968,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"陈敬","text":"凉风生海国，万树动秋声。\n野阔星华地，潮平月上城。\n穷通知有命，贫贱恐无名。\n且学欧阳子，携书就短檠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28969,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"嘉兴道中","author":"潘鸿","text":"泽国春阴重，掀篷纵远眸。\n烟笼三塔寺，云罨百花洲。\n出世空成愿，劳生尚未休。\n试看青草岸，閒极有沙鸥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28970,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山行","author":"柳渔","text":"雨后秋山翠满坡，行行翘首望嵯峨。\n斜通线路人踪少，饥下巉岩虎迹多。\n万树声乾黄叶堕，一筇影曳白云过。\n天将薄暝思投宿，喜听归樵隔水歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28971,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"醉歌","author":"于芳洲","text":"夷齐死于名，蹠蹻死于利。\n一笑古来人，多为名利系。\n古人已矣醉埃尘，不如饮酒全吾真。\n酒酣梦入醉乡去，忽复捞月沧江滨。\n觉来不问此何日，一声长啸通天津。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28972,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谢文节公号钟琴歌为吴素江明经作","author":"于芳洲","text":"信州兵败公潜踪，随身长物惟号钟。\n垂帘卜肆一再鼓，惊猿唳鹤凄心胸。\n东山桐，西山梓，发露精诚声变徵，几时流转入燕京，跣足麻衣抱琴死。\n沧桑变易五百年，断丝枯木若为传。\n自来神物久必显，岂肯灭没随秋烟。\n吴君嗜古兼尚义，铭刻摩挲叠山字，解囊坏漆郁苍凉，斑斑尽是遗民泪。\n遗民泪竭东海枯，冬青树老啼哀乌。\n请弹丞相《松风曲》，再访闽中《何氏图》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28973,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山居杂咏","author":"王毓","text":"随分栖迟十亩宫，此身幸喜免飘蓬。\n醉醒久已闻渔父，得失终期学塞翁。\n肯使壮心惭刻鹄，漫将清兴托雕虫。\n世机祇觉从兹息，坐对秋山落照红。\n茅檐习静坐高春，仗酒浇平磊块胸。\n终日守株宁待兔，三年学技笑屠龙。\n閒愁似草经霜减，野兴如花著雨浓。\n试上山头寻故事，读书台畔暮云封。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28974,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"吴教一","text":"且向烟霞寄此身，一瓢一钵许相亲。\n柴门花落馀残梦，草阁云深殢晚春。\n差喜地偏心更远，尽教时过局翻新。\n年来自笑生涯足，满砌苔钱孰道贫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28975,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"飞云洞","author":"黄合初","text":"路入东坡道，玲珑古洞幽。\n云飞山欲动，雨过瀑争流。\n峭石撑孤阁，苍松倚小楼。\n文成遗碣在，读罢暮烟浮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28976,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"诸葛洞","author":"黄合初","text":"满耳滩声吼，轻舟不可留。\n为收诸葛米，来拜武乡侯。\n洞古千年雪，林深五月秋。\n此间结庐住，补种竹清修。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28977,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙马潭","author":"黄合初","text":"访胜逢迟日，春风拂面生。\n浮舟经古渡，倚树听流莺。\n地僻人踪少，云深石径平。\n仙源何处是，一水绕蓬瀛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28978,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丈人观","author":"黄合初","text":"万山环绕白云封，古树盘空鸟道丛。\n我叩仙坛清昼寂，倚阑时听一声钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28979,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"由上元宫之赵公山访丈人村","author":"黄合初","text":"云烟面面出层峦，结伴寻幽叩石坛。\n水送桃花溪几曲，苔封石室路千盘。\n未逢常偓心先醉，欲仿荆关下笔难。\n咫尺会须凌绝顶，相逢一笑海天宽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28980,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"泰清宫观云气烹茶放歌","author":"黄合初","text":"泰清仙界云轮囷，群峰滉洋悬无垠。\n呼朋拂袖历磴上，万象一白迷鸿钧。\n麻姑池畔鸳鸯井，泉香而洌汲修绠。\n携来古鼎试烹茶，雀舌乳花泛清影。\n我亦自信有仙缘，几番杖策来层巅。\n餐霞吸露润诗腑，吟破白云枕石眠。\n挂瓢久熟胡麻饭，食之能令筋骨健。\n五体清凉百病除，何须八石经时炼。\n白云涧内白云深，云静天青涧壑沈。\n茶罢天风吹飒飒，好听松梢万叶吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28981,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灌口场望迎仙阁","author":"黄合初","text":"已近迎仙阁，滩犹斗石鸣。\n停琴招白鹤，回首望青城。\n云护岸难数，山空雪有声。\n重来学观化，万物尽浮生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28982,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入山","author":"黄合初","text":"半日峨眉道，扶筇意洒然。\n片云飞绝壁，夜雨长流泉。\n偶憩三生石，来探小洞天。\n疏钟何处发，馀韵袅林烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28983,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日过万里桥","author":"黄合初","text":"万里桥边路，春来几度过。\n柳阴新水活，云意远山多。\n幻质非金石，閒情寄薜萝。\n偶逢江上侣，招我著渔蓑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28984,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠琴吟","author":"黄合初","text":"我有空山侣，响雪与流泉。\n相随经一载，何处寻成连。\n君是河阳辞赋手，奇书满架无不有。\n况擅史笔称三长，文献徵搜志不朽。\n汉家陵庙武乡祠，《蜀志》遗文时见之。\n典章金石详考订，非君博雅其谁为。\n羽流何幸附骥尾，一脉薪传继遗轨。\n小草药物收笼中，下里之词惭众美。\n书成直欲驾前贤，蜀中快睹珍珠船。\n祠堂永作琅嬛笈，顿教纸贵钞流传。\n愧乏琼琚何以报，流泉好奏《高山操》。\n安雅堂中持赠君，君应对此欣然笑。\n芙蓉开处试一弹，行看花县赓同调。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28985,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶山","author":"许湘","text":"瓶山虽小山，寄迹聊高吟。\n清风徐徐来，一枕长松林。\n有时北窗下，悠然复鸣琴。\n惜无钟期遇，奏此《流水》音。\n怪哉褦襶客，溽暑犹招寻。\n不知静者意，有傲羲皇心。\n流光亦何速，绿树皆成阴。\n寄言林宗子，就我来登临。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28986,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十月十日与频伽丹叔退庵霁青诸君驯鹿庄看菊","author":"许湘","text":"城中二郭颇閒放，骚坛久已推飞将。\n今晨一纸偶然来，约我清游共酬唱。\n小舟低著六幅篷，打桨竟过东城东。\n水花溅衣凫鸭乱，一篙刺入芦花中。\n晚来舍舟急登岸，寒花正值开其半。\n主人好事正候客，篱角柴门启一扇。\n欣然置酒命开筵，挥毫觅句争留连。\n待得明春好风月，再赏梅花歌《白雪》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28987,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重阳","author":"许湘","text":"年华弹指又重阳，此日登临兴倍长。\n风急雁行频聚散，霜高树色杂青黄。\n林閒夕照明如画，篱下幽花晚更香。\n几度阑干凭眺望，暮云秋景太苍苍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28988,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过富香吏茂才村舍","author":"赵莲","text":"村舍拟柴桑，门临碌碡场。\n野花人不识，山果鸟先尝。\n琴韵随流水，书声出短墙。\n浑忘茶话久，归路满斜阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28989,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孟夏访香吏不值用皎然访陆鸿渐韵","author":"赵莲","text":"苍然天欲暮，一路见桑麻。\n密树藏栖鸟，空潭聚落花。\n问奇频载酒，独往竟忘家。\n叩户无人应，柴门傍水斜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28990,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山中春暮","author":"赵莲","text":"涧草岩花入望齐，绿阴浓压画檐低。\n道人终日静无事，高枕白云听鸟啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28991,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"张谦","text":"一粟乾坤泡影微，苍松翠竹自相依。\n冰霜寒甚无椒酒，刀尺声催尚葛衣。\n小有才华非至理，绝无闻见是玄机。\n古今不少高贤传，毕竟柴桑似者稀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28992,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"西水驿","author":"张谦","text":"停桡西水驿，击柝已三更。\n野阔诗怀壮，天寒酒力轻。\n雁声惊别梦，月色鉴离情。\n江上多渔唱，征人睡未成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28993,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高士湖","author":"张谦","text":"凉风瑟瑟起菰蒲，九十九峰青此湖。\n高士不来鹤飞去，沙堤剩有月轮孤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28994,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过友人旧宅","author":"张谦","text":"旧板桥边处士家，三间老屋自欹斜。\n野风忽送香过涧，开遍墙阴卐字花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28995,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"画梅一枝题赠潘恂九还巴陵","author":"王至甸","text":"秋风满襟袖，归棹洞庭阴。\n一醉写疏影，岁寒盟此心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28996,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂录道藏因以自嘲","author":"王至甸","text":"《五千言》亦归无极，三十年来访太初。\n今日定教蠹鱼笑，又翻绿字写仙书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28997,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过惠阳花隐洲","author":"王至甸","text":"曲曲林亭澹澹春，水声花影四无邻。\n明年石上寻鸿爪，谁识玄都旧道人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28998,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮秋感 其一","author":"王至甸","text":"翩翩野鹤无归处，五岳云烟脚底生。\n飞落江南人不识，春潮犹打石头城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":28999,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮秋感 其二","author":"王至甸","text":"劫后楼台感不胜，卅年如梦数中兴。\n红桥西去垂杨老，照尽沧桑几处镫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29000,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮秋感 其三","author":"王至甸","text":"旧院风流尚管弦，黄冠云水亦华颠。\n卧吹横笛淮波晚，一舸重来自在眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29001,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮秋感 其四","author":"王至甸","text":"江花暮合水烟疏，门绕青溪认旧居。\n醉眼迢迢凝望久，夕阳多是六朝馀。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29002,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水云亭","author":"王至甸","text":"爽气忽无际，水云如许青。\n松高荫萝幄，塔远戛风铃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29003,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将往金陵留别鄂中诸友","author":"王至甸","text":"虚舟原不系，来去只随缘。\n惜此苔岑好，要之金石坚。\n东风白门柳，斜日汉阳船。\n一别情何极，相思鼓七弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29004,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"种松图陈雪盦属题","author":"王至甸","text":"雪盦先生今之豪，须眉奇古声价高。\n一枝铁笔轶斯相，贫老但爱听松涛。\n清风明月不须买，突兀双龙知几载。\n自言手种向空山，一醉松阴化云海。\n虬枝压檐青复青，毛公服松能变形。\n他年袖石乞篆刻，荷锸还从掘茯苓。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29005,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赵季和刻青田石章见赠时将归蜀因为诗以报之","author":"王至甸","text":"法古以神不以迹，赵君篆入斯冰室。\n十年悬腕如拨镫，一刀凿透青田石。\n翩翩野鹤初飞回，脱手赠我疑琼瑰。\n自嫌雕刻壮夫耻，笔力真可回云雷。\n文三桥，王山麓，当年此技称绝工。\n江山跌宕有寒饿，而君莫叹相如穷。\n叙州风，雅州雨，临邛垆头酒如乳。\n还家一醉对文君，却胜黄冠作羁旅。\n此别重逢复几年，相看黯黯俱华颠。\n傥思老朽诗情苦，乞与巴东十万笺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":29006,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]